        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spectral Estimation - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. Divide N-sample record into K overlapping segments of length M:\n   ┌─────────────────────┐\n   │ Segment 1 (length M)│\n   └─────────────────────┘\n         ┌────────────────────────┐\n         │ Segment 2 (50% overlap)│\n         └────────────────────────┘\n               ┌─────────────────────┐\n               │ Segment 3           │\n               └─────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SPECTRAL-ESTIMATION.md#027",
      "path": [
        "07-SPECTRAL-ESTIMATION.md"
