        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spectral Estimation - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. Apply window to each segment: w[n]·xₖ[n]"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SPECTRAL-ESTIMATION.md#028",
      "path": [
        "07-SPECTRAL-ESTIMATION.md"
