        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spectral Estimation - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. Compute periodogram for each segment:\n   I_k(f) = (1/MU) |Σ w[n]·xₖ[n]·e^{-j2πfn}|²\n   where U = (1/M)Σw²[n] (normalizes for window power)"
    },
    {
