        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spectral Estimation - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "4. Average all periodograms:\n   Ŝxx(f) = (1/K) Σ I_k(f)"
    },
    {
